   "motion_no": 2,
   "body": "PlanningCommission",
   "mover": "Layton",
   "seconder": "Ricks",
   "motion": "approve the Conditional Use Permit for the McQuinn Accessory Building located at 2163 East Pheasant Way subject to the following: Conditions: 1. The use of the structure is residential and shall follow Holladay\u2019s land use regulations. Specifically, it may not support a commercial business, long-term or short-term rental, commercial storage, or leasing activities. 2. The accumulative total of accessory buildings may not exceed a footprint of 2,000 square feet or an overall height of 35 vertical feet. 3. Architectural treatments are required as the permit submitted drawings. 4. The conditional use shall run with the land and not the applicant. 5. The conditional use is subject to inspection upon complaint of non-compliance with the permit. 6. The applicant shall apply for and obtain an approved Building Permit for both structures",
   "motion_type": "Land-Use/Zoning",
   "result": "The motion passed unanimously.",
